{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_04_end","storyGroup":"act41side","storySort":9,"storyDependence":"act41side_level_act41side_04_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"EA-4","storyName":"旧舞步","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"雕像燃烧的广场上，过去与现在的舞约重叠，爱布拉娜与拉芙希妮隔着已逝的英雄对峙。一切结束后，拉芙希妮受到托付，带逝者离开纳斯尔纱，前往遗迹。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act41side/level_act41side_04_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act41side_04","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":7,"next":9,"characters":["拉芙希妮","爱布拉娜","布莉吉","涅梅丝","严肃的守灵人"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"read2","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_weaamonologue_2","channel":"read2","loop":"false","id":11},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>高傲的红龙没有朋友，只会偶尔和镜子里的自己聊聊天。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":12},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>有一年的夏末节，她要举办一场盛大的宴会，需要镜中人出来帮忙，但她们两个不能同时出现在别人面前，否则镜中人就会消失。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":13},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>镜中人不得不遵循红龙的命令，出发去邀请神秘的守灵人。守灵人却无论如何也不愿赴宴，还劝镜中人不要再回去。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":14},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>但镜中人仍然只身回到红龙的巢穴。此时宴会已经开始，镜中人连忙躲进篝火外的黑暗。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":15},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>不知不觉中，来赴宴的人一个个消失，而红龙硬是把镜中人从黑暗中拉出来，强迫她和自己跳舞。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":16},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>她们跳啊跳，跳啊跳，镜中人觉得自己的脚趾都要掉了，她想休息一会儿，红龙却无论如何也不肯停下来。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":17},{"type":"subtitle","id":18},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0","fadetime":"3","channel":"read2","id":19},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":20},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":21},{"type":"dialog","id":22},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":23},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":24},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":25},{"type":"charslot","id":26},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":27},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":28},{"type":"char","duration":"0.1","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":29},{"type":"bg","duration":"0.1","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":30},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":31},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"read2","fadetime":"0.5","id":32},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":33},{"type":"text","text":"给，拉芙希妮。","id":34},{"type":"text","text":"你要的书，蒸汽骑士冒险故事的续集。","id":35},{"type":"dialog","id":36},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":37,"musicid":1},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_bg_21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2.5","block":"true","id":38},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":39},{"type":"text","text":"你问我，“为什么”？","id":40},{"type":"text","text":"这不需要理由，我亲爱的妹妹。","id":41},{"type":"dialog","id":42},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","duration":"1.5","id":43},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":44},{"type":"text","text":"只是，你真的需要读它吗？","id":45},{"type":"text","text":"读一本要不是迫于同龄人的压力，你其实根本就不感兴趣的书？","id":46},{"type":"dialog","id":47},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.7","id":48},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":49},{"type":"char","duration":"0.5","from":"1","to":"0","id":50},{"type":"bg","duration":"1","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":51},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1684_1#22$1","focus":"m","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"这是我自己想看的。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_npc_1684_1-22$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"你不是对父亲说过的吗，你不想被其他人问，为什么会有维多利亚人不喜欢看蒸汽骑士的故事。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_1685_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1684_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"这本书......是爸爸让你帮我买的吗？","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FD/Avg_avg_npc_1684_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"怎么会呢。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1685_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1684_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"那你......为什么会知道？","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7F/Avg_avg_npc_1684_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"你在后退，拉芙希妮。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_npc_1685_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"我不喜欢你像其他人一样畏惧我。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_npc_1685_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1684_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"不，我......","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_npc_1684_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"如果你这么害怕被我知道这些，不如来跟我跳一支舞，缓解一下紧张，如何？","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_npc_1685_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1684_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"真的是......跳舞吗？","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8D/Avg_avg_npc_1684_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"为什么不可以是呢？","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1685_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":74},{"type":"charslot","id":75},{"type":"text","text":"说着，爱布拉娜甚至优雅地朝妹妹伸出手。","id":76},{"type":"text","text":"但在拉芙希妮的印象里，即便在父母放起一家人都喜欢的音乐，父亲摇头晃脑，母亲用手指在桌上敲着节拍的时候......","id":77},{"type":"text","text":"姐姐都只是冷冷地笑着，端坐在原位。","id":78},{"type":"text","text":"她从未跟着音乐舞动过身体。一次都没有过。","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"当你能跟上我脚步的时候，你就不必再为一本书、一个请求，或是几个同龄的朋友烦忧了。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_npc_1685_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1684_1#25$1","focus":"m","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E9/Avg_avg_npc_1684_1-25$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":84},{"type":"charslot","id":85},{"type":"playsound","key":"$book_close","volume":"1","id":86},{"type":"text","text":"还没拆封的骑士小说掉在地上，新书好闻的气味被泥水掩没。","id":87},{"type":"text","text":"她还太小，她没想过如愿以偿也能如此沉重苦涩，她只记得自己踉跄着转身离开，没有握住那只伸向自己的......","id":88},{"type":"text","text":"柔软而冰冷的手。","id":89},{"type":"dialog","id":90},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":91},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":92},{"type":"charslot","id":93},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_bg_59_g4_dragonsquare_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":94},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":95},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":96},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":97},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"拉芙希妮。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"人群已经散去，不必再隐藏自己的身份了。","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":102},{"type":"charslot","id":103},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":"1","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","duration":"1","id":105},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"现在你仍然觉得他们还活着吗？","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我只知道，每个塔拉人心中都燃烧着这样的火。从我们的先祖向维多利亚人俯首开始，火就从未熄灭过。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"城里的人如此，那些随我回来的人们，他们也是一样，只是他们的火从未染上死亡的颜色。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"不错的比喻，拉芙希妮。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"那么，我现在再来问问你吧，你要怎么办呢？","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"再去把那团火漆成你的颜色？我想你一定已经试过了。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"无论是谁，一旦沾染了死亡，你的火焰就只能将其化为灰烬。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"所以，拉芙希妮，杀死我。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"同时杀死城里的所有人？","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"如果你真的这么在意一件事会如何被记述，你也可以说，是我杀了他们，你只是把他们埋葬了。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"纳斯尔纱的人们还活着。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"哪怕驱动那具身体的已经只剩死亡，而非生命？","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"如果真的连一点生命的火种都不存在，他们早就变成你那些游荡、无知无识的行尸了。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"他们早晚会的。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"不，他们不会。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我宁愿将活人身上的紫火看作一场瘟疫，一场因你而起的瘟疫。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$2","focus":"m","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"那么，你要去给这场瘟疫寻找解药了？","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1B/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-15$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"没错。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我希望那解药能让你也一并痊愈，爱布拉娜。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#16$2","focus":"m","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"真好。","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-16$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"真......好？","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#16$2","focus":"m","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"是啊，真好，拉芙希妮。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-16$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"你自己还没注意到吗？","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"你已经在想如何治愈我，而不是如何逃避我了。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":151},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":152},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":153},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1B/Avg_59_i05.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","fadetime":"2","id":154},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","block":"false","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"来跳舞吧，拉芙希妮。跳那支我一直想邀你一起，你却总是逃开的舞。","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"你说......什么？","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"我说，来跳舞吧，拉芙希妮。","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"在最后一个小节之前，用你的枪贯穿我的心脏。致死的瘟疫没有解药，你的意志足够坚定，你的行动却终将只是徒劳。","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"来吧，别再逃避宿命了......纳斯尔纱的，还有我们的。","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"夏末节还没到，但生与死之间的界限已经比塔拉历史上的任何时刻都要模糊。","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"你真的想让塔拉变成死的国度吗？","id":163},{"type":"dialog","id":164},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":165},{"type":"text","text":"拉芙希妮下意识地转过头去。","id":166},{"type":"text","text":"炽烈的紫火仍在英雄一路拖行至此的骨架上熊熊燃烧，而刚刚被紫火占据，猛地站起的库林的身体，此刻也跪倒在地。","id":167},{"type":"text","text":"她不忍再看，于是回过头，直视姐姐的双眼，和那只时隔多年重新伸给自己的手。","id":168},{"type":"text","text":"不知是错觉，还是紫火笼罩下的一切都会失去生机，相比记忆之中，她眼前那只手白得毫无血色。","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"这是一座城市，这是无数人的生命。爱布拉娜，这不是能用宿命两个字轻飘飘地概括的东西。","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"说完了吗？我觉得我们已经在各自的频道讲得够久了。","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......爱布拉娜！","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"你大可以继续长篇大论下去，反正只要你想，我就会站在这里等你。","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"只是快些，拉芙希妮。你终究是等得起的，其他人却未必。","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"（深呼吸）你说得对，你终究是等得起的，但其他人却未必。","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"好，这场舞我陪你跳，直到我们中有一个倒地不起为止。","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"但我不会按你的舞步来。决不。","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"悉听尊便。","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"只是有一件事你会错意了，亲爱的拉芙希妮。","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"那个等不起的人，此刻就站在你面前呢。","id":180},{"type":"dialog","id":181},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":182},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":183},{"type":"charslot","id":184},{"type":"image","id":185},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":186},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":187},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":188},{"type":"text","text":"等不起？","id":189},{"type":"text","text":"拉芙希妮紧紧盯着姐姐的脸庞，她突然意识到一件彻头彻尾离题的事情。","id":190},{"type":"text","text":"那只手的苍白并非错觉。","id":191},{"type":"text","text":"紫火几乎编织成一张铺天盖地的披风，让爱布拉娜显得美丽而可怖，却也无法掩饰她皮肤里透出的，如同消耗性的恶疾作祟一样的惨白。","id":192},{"type":"text","text":"她不该是这样的，她从没像这样过。","id":193},{"type":"dialog","id":194},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":195},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":196},{"type":"charslot","id":197},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_bg_59_g4_dragonsquare_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":199},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":200},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":201},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"爱布拉娜，你......","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"嗯？","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"你......","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"姐姐，你......还好吗？","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":210},{"type":"charslot","id":211},{"type":"text","text":"爱布拉娜脸上泛起笑意。那笑总挂在她的脸上，冷冰冰的。","id":212},{"type":"text","text":"此刻那笑容仿佛有了些温度，却更显得那惨白的脸触目惊心。","id":213},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"多谢关心，拉芙希妮。","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#16$2","focus":"m","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"在这些冷漠的别离与苦楚的团聚之后，能听见你的问候，也真的是......久违了。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-16$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"顺便，我倒也确实想和你跳一场舞，拉芙希妮。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......等我找到治好你的方法，我会和你跳的。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"很好，我会在这里等着的。","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":224},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_marblefootsteps_loop","volume":"0.6","loop":"true","channel":"awalk","id":225},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"awalk","fadetime":"2.5","id":226},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":227},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":228},{"type":"text","text":"爱布拉娜信步走向堡垒，那脚步声飘渺到虚弱。","id":229},{"type":"dialog","id":230},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":231},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":232},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":233},{"type":"charslot","id":234},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_bg_59_g4_dragonsquare_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":235},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":236},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_monastery_nomal.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":237,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":238},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":239},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","duration":"1","id":241},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"呼......","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"呼......红龙！涅梅丝！","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"我到城门的时候，那里一个人都没有！我知道一定是出了什么事，广场上到底——","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":248},{"type":"charslot","id":249},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","duration":"0.5","id":251},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":252},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":"1","id":253},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"红龙，这......是？","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9B/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":258},{"type":"charslot","id":259},{"type":"text","text":"拉芙希妮怀中抱着一个小小的匣子。在夜间昏暗的灯光下，似乎什么都比平日更加模糊。","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我救不了库林，只能......","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......只能以这种方式给他安息，让他不必继续在广场上受死火的煎熬。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":266},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.7","id":267},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":268},{"type":"text","text":"游牧人沉默了半晌，在地上摸索到一枚石头。","id":269},{"type":"text","text":"她铆足浑身的力气，将那枚石头狠狠砸向堡垒的方向。","id":270},{"type":"text","text":"但那石头旋即被夜里的黑暗吞没，甚至没有发出一丝声响。","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"宵禁已经开始了。涅梅丝、布莉吉，我们先——","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"不......","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"不。","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":278},{"type":"charslot","id":279},{"type":"text","text":"涅梅丝伸手从木匣上方虚虚拂过，似乎试图擦去一些不存在的灰尘。","id":280},{"type":"text","text":"她忽然想起几天前，自己被原本的同族拒绝时，那人对自己说的一些多余的话。","id":281},{"type":"dialog","id":282},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":283},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":284},{"type":"charslot","id":285},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A5/Avg_bg_59_g5_remains_outside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":286},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":287},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":288},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":289},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.3","fadetime":"1","id":290},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":291},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":292},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"守灵人不和生者团结，也不需要生者的尊重，除非他们已经死去。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_npc_1691_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"这才是深池理当尊重的传统。","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_npc_1691_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"无论如何，多谢您还愿意给我这枚哨笛......我回去了。","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"等等，涅梅丝。你明知道夏末节将至，守灵人不太可能拿得出什么祭器，但你还是来了。","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1691_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"那些深池强迫你来的？","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1691_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"不，是我自己——","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"涅梅丝，你的性格还真是一点没变。","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D6/Avg_avg_npc_1691_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"等待、斡旋、调和......你在纳斯尔纱，在那条红龙的麾下，也执着于这样吗？","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D6/Avg_avg_npc_1691_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我只是......不希望看到本该向好的情况恶化，本该同心协力的人起冲突。","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"假如冲突本就无法避免，你只会在其中越陷越深。","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_npc_1691_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"城市将你浸染得黯淡了，涅梅丝。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_npc_1691_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":311},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":312},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":313},{"type":"charslot","id":314},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_bg_59_g4_dragonsquare_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":315},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":316},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":317},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":318},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":319},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":320},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":321},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"所以领袖——红龙——","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"所以，爱布拉娜是不会给纳斯尔纱带来真正的生活的，对吗，拉芙希妮？","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"她说她做不到。她......其实并不喜欢撒谎，除非另有制约......","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":327},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"她已经是整个塔拉的领袖，独一无二的红龙，还有什么能制约她？！","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我......","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3A/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"涅梅丝，你怎么了？你看起来......不对劲......","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$distressed_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_distressed_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":334,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我明白了。拉芙希妮殿下，我突然明白了。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3A/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"看来那火的确是会侵染活人的。","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3A/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"涅梅丝？！","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我曾经依赖的人们，原来是一群中饱私囊的蛀虫。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3A/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我曾经信仰的领袖，原来是一条目无他人生死的恶龙。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3A/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我曾经不惜性命捍卫的人们......我的挚友为他们而死。","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3A/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"甚至，如果不是那条恶龙用紫火将他点燃，我都不知道他们还会对他做些什么......","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"库林问得对，等到夏末节过去，我该做什么？","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3A/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"除了复仇，我没有什么可做的了。","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3A/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":349},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":350},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_deathfire","volume":"0.4","id":351},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":352,"style":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_purple_fire","slot":"bgover","x":"20","y":"-20","layer":"1"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":353},{"type":"text","text":"这句话说出口之后，拉芙希妮看见，最后一名还未沾染紫火的纳斯尔纱居民，她身上燃起了火焰。","id":354},{"type":"dialog","id":355},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":356},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":357},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":358},{"type":"charslot","id":359},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_bg_59_g4_dragonsquare_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":360},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":361},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":362},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"拉芙希妮殿下，您会因此将我当成城里人的同类，爱布拉娜的仆臣吗？","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"不，只是这致死的恶疾......终于传染到了最后一个城里人身上。","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"既然这样，拉芙希妮殿下，我发誓，我会协助您把这支强加给您的舞一直跳下去，一直跳下去......","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"直到那条邪恶的红龙倒下。","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3A/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......我听见了你的誓言。","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"接下来，我得离开纳斯尔纱一趟。跟我一起走吧，涅梅丝。","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"守灵人的聚落，是吗？","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"嗯。城里已经没有治愈那火焰的希望，我得去找到任何可能帮得上忙的人。","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"不，我不会去。我已经没有资格回去了。","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我会在城市里待下去。只要没被红龙注意到，没被她撕成碎片......我会努力不让事态继续恶化。","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3A/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"这枚哨笛麻烦您还回去吧。","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"还有......库林也拜托您了。请您给库林一个真正的葬礼。","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"葬礼上需要亲友念诵悼词，我......我写一份，您帮我念，好吗？","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......好。","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":389},{"type":"charslot","id":390},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_penrustle","volume":"1","id":391},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":392},{"type":"dialog","id":393},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":394},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":395},{"type":"charslot","id":396},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_bg_59_g4_dragonsquare_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":397},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":398},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":399},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_writerub","volume":"1","id":400},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":401},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"好了。给。","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"我陪苇草一起离开。黑林现在不放任何人出入，我们两个人，或许会顺利一点。","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"不，布莉吉，你得留下，我需要你的帮助。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"苇草？","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9B/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我一个人没关系的。","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"倒也可以，可......涅梅丝，你越来越不像你自己了。","id":413,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9B/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"......也许这就是复仇会把人变成的样子。","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":416},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":417},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":418},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"read2","id":419},{"type":"charslot","id":420},{"type":"image","id":421}],"characters":["拉芙希妮","爱布拉娜","布莉吉","涅梅丝","严肃的守灵人"]}